    "created_at": "2017-01-10T14:06:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-10T14:06:40Z",
    "body": "I would feel more comfortable about this if we had any implementer interest from implementations besides Firefox in the change proposal. As-is, I don't think it's accurate to say that it's expected to change. It's just another API of many that Firefox and Edge don't implement, and that's taken care of by the caniuse box already.",
