    "created_at": "2017-01-10T14:30:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-10T14:30:07Z",
    "body": "It's not an API that Firefox doesn't implement but expects to sometime.  It's an API that Firefox considers an unacceptable privacy leak in its current form and will not implement in that form, period.\r\n\r\nBut yes, I would like to hear _some_ feedback on my change proposal from Blink, of course.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
