    "created_at": "2017-01-10T14:32:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-10T15:11:26Z",
    "body": "Adding a note saying \"Firefox considers this API to be a privacy leak and that's why it's not implemented in Firefox\" seems more honest than saying that the API is expected to change (and implying that maybe that's why Edge isn't implementing it).\r\n\r\nI'm still not sure that's a job for the spec though. Maybe a Mozilla Hacks blog post and a caniuse footnote linking to it.",
