    "created_at": "2017-02-20T12:41:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-02-20T12:41:31Z",
    "body": "We have two implementations, one objection, and one unknown. It's not entirely clear to me that doing nothing is helpful either. I was hoping that by more clearly calling it out in the standard more folks would feel like trying to solve this somehow. ",
